    <summary>Lightweight 10Gbps WireGuard VPN, free 30-second Home Wi-Fi device scanner, and Smart-TV ACR telemetry shield for Windows 10/11.</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR VPN is an ultra-lightweight native Rust + Tauri v2 10Gbps RAM-only WireGuard VPN and Free 30-Second Home Wi-Fi Security Scanner for Windows 10 and Windows 11. Features zero-logs WireGuard tunnel encryption, public Wi-Fi packet protection, ISP bandwidth throttling defense, local LAN and Wi-Fi device discovery (ARP, mDNS, and SSDP), and optional Smart-TV ACR telemetry blocking with zero background bloatware.</description>
